{"id":640,"date":"2026-11-26T00:01:00","date_gmt":"2026-11-25T23:01:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/?p=640"},"modified":"2026-11-26T09:24:14","modified_gmt":"2026-11-26T08:24:14","slug":"jdwold-os-package-manager-unified-dispatcher","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/jdwos-blog\/mr_jack\/640\/","title":{"rendered":"J\u00d0W\u00d8\u00aeL\u00d0 \u00d8S Package Manager (Unified Dispatcher)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">L&#8217;Evoluzione Naturale del J\u00d0W\u00d8\u00aeL\u00d0 \u00d8S Package Manager <\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sintassi Unificata del Package Manager (<code>jdwos<\/code>)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Con l&#8217;introduzione del nuovo <strong>Unified Dispatcher (<code>jdwos<\/code>)<\/strong> la gestione dell&#8217;intero ecosistema diventa ancora pi\u00f9 rapida e coerente, abbandonando i vecchi comandi frammentati a favore di una sintassi moderna e intuitiva con scorciatoie integrate.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><th>Comando Principale<\/th><th>Scorciatoie (Alias)<\/th><th>Descrizione Operativa<\/th><\/tr><tr><td><code>sudo jdwos install &lt;pacchetto&gt;<\/code><\/td><td><code>in<\/code> -i <code>-S<\/code> setup<\/td><td>Scarica, estrae in RAM e installa il pacchetto <code>.jdw<\/code> selezionato.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><code>sudo jdwos update &lt;pacchetto&gt;<\/code><\/td><td><code>up<\/code> &#8211;<code>u<\/code> <code>-Sy<\/code><\/td><td>Forza il controllo e l&#8217;installazione dell&#8217;ultima release disponibile per il singolo pacchetto.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><code>sudo jdwos update-all<\/code><\/td><td><code>up-all<\/code> <code>-Syu<\/code><\/td><td>Scansiona e aggiorna automaticamente in sequenza tutti i pacchetti <code>.jdw<\/code> installati sul sistema (dando priorit\u00e0 ai componenti core).<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><code>sudo jdwos remove &lt;pacchetto&gt;<\/code><\/td><td><code>rm<\/code> &#8211;<code>r<\/code> <code>-R<\/code> <\/td><td>Esegue la rimozione chirurgica del pacchetto e dei suoi file residui senza toccare le dipendenze di sistema.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><code>jdwos list<\/code><\/td><td><code>ls<\/code> &#8211;<code>l<\/code><\/td><td>Elenca tutti i pacchetti disponibili e installati mostrando versione e data dell&#8217; ultimo aggiornamento.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><code>jdwos info &lt;pacchetto&gt;<\/code><\/td><td><code>show<\/code><\/td><td>Visualizza la scheda tecnica completa, le dipendenze ed una breve descrizione del pacchetto.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><code>jdwos help<\/code><\/td><td><code>-h<\/code>, <code>--help<\/code><\/td><td>Mostra la guida rapida ai comandi direttamente nel terminale.<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><code>jdwos alias<\/code><\/td><td><\/td><td>Visualizza tutti gli alias del JDWOS-PM<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>(Per garantire la massima retrocompatibilit\u00e0 con gli script esistenti, i comandi classici <code>jdw-install<\/code>, <code>jdw-remove<\/code>, <code>jdw-list<\/code> <code>jdw-list <\/code>e <code>jdw-info<\/code> restano pienamente operativi).<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udce6 Scheda Tecnica del Pacchetto<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Name<\/strong>: J\u00d0W\u00d8\u00aeL\u00d0 \u00d8S Package Manager (<strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-luminous-vivid-amber-color\"><a href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/JDWorld\/jdwos-pm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">jdwos-pm<\/a><\/mark><\/strong>)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Architecture<\/strong>: Nativa Indipendente (x86_64)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Distro<\/strong>: Arch Linux<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>License(s)<\/strong>: Simplified BSD License<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Maintainers<\/strong>: JDWorld<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Package Size<\/strong>: <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Build Date:<\/strong> 19-06-2026<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Update Date<\/strong>: 26-11-2026<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Anteprima: jdwos alias &#8211; Scorciatoie Comandi (Alias)<\/h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"882\" height=\"398\" src=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-alias.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-643\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-alias.png 882w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-alias-300x135.png 300w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-alias-768x347.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 882px) 100vw, 882px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">comando: jdwos alias<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Anteprims: jdwos help (Modulare, se c\u00e8 lo vedi altrimenti non lo vedi): <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>J\u00d0W\u00d8\u00aeL\u00d0 \u00d8S Package Manager<\/strong> (<em>sempre visibile<\/em>): contiene gli aiuti per il Package Manager con citazioni dinamiche ad ogni avvio<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>J\u00d0W\u00d8\u00aeL\u00d0 \u00d8S<\/strong> <strong>FastFetch Custom<\/strong> (<em>vsisibile solo se <\/em><code>jdwos-ff-stm<\/code><em> \u00e8 installato<\/em>): contiene i comandi per visualizzare i 4 profili grafici intercambiabili di <strong><em>FastFetch<\/em><\/strong> con url dinamici ad ogni avvio<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>J\u00d0W\u00d8\u00aeL\u00d0 \u00d8S Text User Interface  <\/strong>(<em>visibile solo se <code>jdwos-ic666<\/code> \u00e8 installato<\/em>), contiene tutti i restanti comandi del <strong><em>J\u00d0W\u00d8\u00aeL\u00d0 \u00d8S<\/em><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"878\" height=\"453\" src=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-pm.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-644\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-pm.png 878w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-pm-300x155.png 300w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-pm-768x396.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 878px) 100vw, 878px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Package Manager<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"906\" height=\"745\" src=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-ff-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-652\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-ff-1.png 906w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-ff-1-300x247.png 300w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-ff-1-768x632.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 906px) 100vw, 906px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Package Manager + FastFetch Custom<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"889\" height=\"712\" src=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-pm-tui.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-653\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/jdwos-help-pm-tui.png 889w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/